  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e556e917cab147b4d9facd1303fad5f7, type: 3}
    subtitle: For when you can't aim, but you really want everyone to know you're
      trying.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 47834d0b543d0f94396b3df3d72487ab, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Here\u2019s your new toy. It spits out bullets faster than you can
